        "content": "<p>Is this supposed to happen? I would have thought that the <code>def bar</code> makes a <code>Bar.bar</code>, instead of a <code>Foo._root_.Bar.bar</code></p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Foo</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- do stuff with `Foo`s</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- now I want to put stuff in the `Bar` namespace</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">root_</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Bar</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bar</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- let's see what I got</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pp</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fullNames</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- info: Foo._root_.Bar.bar : Nat -/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">check</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bar</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
